Package: PQDM
Title: Power Quality Data Mining
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Max", "Domagk", , "mdomagk@posteo.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
  )
Description: Methods for the analysis of long-term power quality measurements
    based on weekly 95th percentiles of 10-minute values. Covers the assessment
    of the quality reserve with respect to user-supplied limits and the
    detection of seasonal variations and trends. All methods are implemented
    as published or submitted by the author; references are given in the documentation
    of each function.
